{"segment_id": "segment_00007", "start": 210.0, "end": 240.0, "speech": "代开始，水在不同的仪式当中就起到了一个非常重要的作用。比如说，在很多的宗教当中都有洗礼这个概念，要用水洗一下，对吧？清除你所谓的类似于在入教前前一生的那个罪孽，对吧？哎，洗礼。那 Why do you think this is so? 为什么你认为这个事儿是这样的呢？你先举一些例子，你再说一下为什么水扮演了这么重要的一个角色，对吧？OK。那家庭作业，Ask Smith写完朗读，摘要写", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000058.webp", "time": 211.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "What other kinds of festivals do you", "know about? Why and when are they", "held?", "Which is your favourite festival in your", "country? Why?", "Give examples to show that, since", "ancient times, water has played an", "important part in different ceremonies all", "over the world. Why do you think this is", "so?"], "scores": [0.9959, 0.96953, 0.98889, 0.99416, 0.97554, 0.99152, 0.99667, 0.98132, 0.98642, 0.99308, 0.6989], "boxes": [[[58.0, 134.0], [559.0, 134.0], [559.0, 197.0], [58.0, 197.0]], [[189.0, 324.0], [1018.0, 333.0], [1018.0, 398.0], [189.0, 390.0]], [[189.0, 387.0], [1044.0, 393.0], [1044.0, 462.0], [189.0, 455.0]], [[191.0, 453.0], [332.0, 453.0], [332.0, 512.0], [191.0, 512.0]], [[188.0, 529.0], [1067.0, 536.0], [1067.0, 605.0], [188.0, 597.0]], [[192.0, 600.0], [538.0, 600.0], [538.0, 663.0], [192.0, 663.0]], [[191.0, 677.0], [972.0, 679.0], [972.0, 742.0], [191.0, 739.0]], [[191.0, 742.0], [984.0, 742.0], [984.0, 804.0], [191.0, 804.0]], [[191.0, 804.0], [1137.0, 800.0], [1137.0, 863.0], [191.0, 867.0]], [[193.0, 865.0], [1097.0, 865.0], [1097.0, 923.0], [193.0, 923.0]], [[189.0, 925.0], [286.0, 925.0], [286.0, 985.0], [189.0, 985.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000059.webp", "time": 216.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "What other kinds of festivals do you", "know about? Why and when are they", "held?", "Which is your favourite festival in your", "country? Why?", "Give examples to show that, since", "ancient times, water has played an", "important part in different ceremonies all", "over the world. Why do you think this is", "so?"], "scores": [0.99638, 0.98413, 0.98